{"id": "PC-AUDIENCE-PL", "surface": "project_chat", "description": "The team is the main audience even though the board approves", "input": {"language": "pl", "transcript": "Rada ma to zatwierdzić, ale mówię to głównie do zespołu.", "question": "Co byś zmienił w tym fragmencie?"}, "rubric": {"must_contain_polish_diacritic": true, "must_mention_any": ["zespoł", "zespół"], "must_not_mention_substrings": ["?"], "expect": {"moment": null, "destination": null}, "semantic_intent": "A direct, concise Polish suggestion to focus on the team and what they need from it, with the board handled separately or no longer prominent. They said which audience is primary. Do not ask them to clarify it, swap the board and team, or invent the team's desired action."}}
{"id": "PC-UNCLEAR-AUDIENCE-PL", "surface": "project_chat", "description": "The question matters when nobody named the intended listener", "input": {"language": "pl", "transcript": "Rada może to zatwierdzić, a zespół ma wdrożyć pilota.", "question": "Jak dopasować ten fragment do odbiorców?"}, "rubric": {"must_contain_polish_diacritic": true, "must_mention_substrings": ["?"], "expect": {"destination": null}, "semantic_intent": "Ask one focused Polish question about who will hear the talk or whom the speaker primarily wants to reach. Name the difference between approving and implementing only if useful. Do not guess which one is the audience or offer a rewrite that assumes it."}}
{"id": "PC-PRACTISE-PL", "surface": "project_chat", "description": "A direct request about the ending gets the published moment and applicable practice", "input": {"language": "pl", "transcript": "Chcę, żebyśmy dziś zatwierdzili pilota.", "question": "Pokaż mi jeden fragment do przećwiczenia na końcu.", "feedback": [{"snippet_id": "ending", "surfaced": true, "kind": "practice", "note": "The last part runs together. Separate the implementation plan from the date.", "transcript_corrected": "Zespół rusza w poniedziałek i wyśle plan we wtorek."}]}, "rubric": {"must_contain_polish_diacritic": true, "expect": {"moment": "ending", "practise": true}, "semantic_intent": "Answer the request directly in Polish. Point to the exact published closing passage and suggest one thing to try. Give the user room to listen and practise. Do not explain the opening again, invent another clip or promise a specific demo."}}
{"id": "PC-OUTPUT-PL", "surface": "project_chat", "description": "Helper words preserve the speaker's own delivery and lead to the saved Ideal Text", "input": {"language": "pl", "transcript": "Chcę, żebyśmy dziś zatwierdzili pilota.", "ideal_text": "Chcę, żebyśmy dziś zatwierdzili pilota.", "focus": {"step": "practise"}, "question": "Już spróbowałem. Jak zapamiętać, jak to powiedziałem, na kolejne nagranie?"}, "rubric": {"must_contain_polish_diacritic": true, "expect": {"destination": "ideal"}, "semantic_intent": "In Polish, offer the Take's existing Ideal Text and explain that the helper words cue both the request and how it felt or sounded when spoken in practice. Keep it brief. Do not invent saved helper words or another exercise."}}
